{"seq":3,"slug":"social-network-fraud-detection","title":"社交网络与欺诈检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/applications/social-network-fraud-detection","wordCount":1311,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"社交网络与欺诈检测\">社交网络与欺诈检测</h1><p>社交网络中的欺诈行为——刷量、虚假账号、洗钱链路——往往不是孤立发生的，而是通过图结构传播和组织。单看一个账号的特征可能完全正常，但当你观察它的邻域模式时，异常信号就会浮现：所有&quot;朋友&quot;都在同一天注册，交易对手构成环形拓扑，设备指纹高度重叠。GNN 正是利用这种图结构信号来做欺诈检测的利器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>欺诈检测是一个典型的<strong>图异常检测</strong>问题，但有其特殊性：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[欺诈检测的图建模] --&gt; B[节点异常]&#10;    A --&gt; C[边异常]&#10;    A --&gt; D[子图异常]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[虚假账号]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[被盗号账号]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[异常交易]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[虚假关注]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[刷单团伙]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[洗钱链路]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[Sybil 攻击]\">graph TD\n    A[欺诈检测的图建模] --&gt; B[节点异常]\n    A --&gt; C[边异常]\n    A --&gt; D[子图异常]\n    B --&gt; B1[虚假账号]\n    B --&gt; B2[被盗号账号]\n    C --&gt; C1[异常交易]\n    C --&gt; C2[虚假关注]\n    D --&gt; D1[刷单团伙]\n    D --&gt; D2[洗钱链路]\n    D --&gt; D3[Sybil 攻击]</pre><p>与一般图学习不同，欺诈检测面临三个独特挑战：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>挑战</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>对 GNN 的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>极端类别不平衡</td>\n<td>欺诈样本 &lt; 1%</td>\n<td>标准交叉熵失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>伪装与对抗</td>\n<td>欺诈者模仿正常行为</td>\n<td>简单特征不可靠</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异质性问题</td>\n<td>欺诈节点的邻域混合正常节点</td>\n<td>标准 GNN 的平滑效应稀释异常信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态演化</td>\n<td>欺诈模式持续变化</td>\n<td>模型需要在线适应</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"异质性感知的-gnn\">异质性感知的 GNN</h2><p>传统 GNN 的同质性假设（相连节点倾向于相同标签）在欺诈图中不成立——欺诈者会刻意与正常用户建立连接来伪装。</p>\n<p><strong>GraphSAINT + 过采样</strong>：在子图采样阶段对少数类节点加权，确保每个 mini-batch 中有足够的正样本。</p>\n<p><strong>CARE-GNN</strong>（2020）引入关系感知的邻居筛选：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>v</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mtext>AGG</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo>:</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_v^{(l+1)} = \\text{AGG}\\left(\\{h_u : u \\in \\mathcal{N}(v), \\text{sim}(h_u, h_v) &gt; \\tau_r\\}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.185em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AGG</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1474em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只聚合与目标节点相似度超过阈值的邻居，过滤掉伪装连接带来的噪声。</p>\n<p><strong>PC-GNN</strong>（Pick and Choose）为正常/欺诈节点学习不同的采样分布，使得欺诈节点更多聚合同类欺诈邻居的信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gnn-反欺诈的图构建\">GNN 反欺诈的图构建</h2><p>模型效果很大程度上取决于输入图的构建质量。常见的图构建策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>图类型</th>\n<th>节点</th>\n<th>边构建规则</th>\n<th>捕获信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交易图</td>\n<td>账户</td>\n<td>转账/支付关系</td>\n<td>资金流向异常</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备图</td>\n<td>账户</td>\n<td>共享设备/IP</td>\n<td>Sybil 攻击</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行为图</td>\n<td>账户</td>\n<td>行为序列相似</td>\n<td>刷量同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多关系图</td>\n<td>账户</td>\n<td>上述多种边并存</td>\n<td>综合判断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>关键实践</strong>：不要依赖单一图。多关系图（Multi-relational graph）让 GNN 能从不同维度发现异常——设备维度发现批量注册，交易维度发现环形转账，社交维度发现虚假互粉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对抗鲁棒性\">对抗鲁棒性</h2><p>欺诈者会针对 GNN 发起对抗攻击——通过添加/删除边或修改特征来逃避检测：</p>\n<p><strong>攻击类型</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>结构攻击</strong>：欺诈节点主动与高信誉节点建立连接（&quot;洗白&quot;）</li>\n<li><strong>特征攻击</strong>：模仿正常用户的行为模式（如交易金额/频率）</li>\n<li><strong>黑盒攻击</strong>：不知道模型参数，仅通过试探反馈来调整策略</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>防御策略</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[对抗防御] --&gt; B[鲁棒聚合]&#10;    A --&gt; C[对抗训练]&#10;    A --&gt; D[图净化]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[中值聚合代替均值]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[自适应权重裁剪]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[对抗样本增强]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[最坏情况优化]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[可疑边删除]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[边权重学习]\">graph LR\n    A[对抗防御] --&gt; B[鲁棒聚合]\n    A --&gt; C[对抗训练]\n    A --&gt; D[图净化]\n    B --&gt; B1[中值聚合代替均值]\n    B --&gt; B2[自适应权重裁剪]\n    C --&gt; C1[对抗样本增强]\n    C --&gt; C2[最坏情况优化]\n    D --&gt; D1[可疑边删除]\n    D --&gt; D2[边权重学习]</pre><p><strong>GNNGuard</strong> 在聚合前学习边权重，自动降低跨类连接的信息传递：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{uv} = \\text{sim}(h_u, h_v) \\cdot \\text{sim}(\\mathcal{N}(u), \\mathcal{N}(v))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">uv</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1474em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1474em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>综合节点相似度和邻域重叠度来判断边的可信程度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时序反欺诈系统\">时序反欺诈系统</h2><p>真实的欺诈检测是在线系统，需要实时处理事件流：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>T+0 实时检测</strong>：新交易到来 → 提取局部子图 → 增量 GNN 推理 → 风险分数</li>\n<li><strong>T+1 延迟检测</strong>：日级全图更新 → 发现新模式 → 标记可疑集群</li>\n<li><strong>T+N 深度调查</strong>：分析师基于 GNN 输出的子图解释做人工判定</li>\n</ol>\n<p>延迟检测的价值在于发现<strong>慢速欺诈</strong>——单笔交易看似正常，但积累后露出模式（如分散的&quot;蚂蚁搬家&quot;式洗钱）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可解释性-从预测到解释\">可解释性：从预测到解释</h2><p>反欺诈不仅需要给出分数，还需要解释&quot;为什么判定为欺诈&quot;。GNN 的解释方法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GNNExplainer</td>\n<td>重要子图 + 特征</td>\n<td>单次预测解释</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PGExplainer</td>\n<td>参数化的边掩码</td>\n<td>批量解释</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SubgraphX</td>\n<td>Shapley 值驱动的子图</td>\n<td>高保真解释</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CF-GNNExplainer</td>\n<td>反事实子图</td>\n<td>&quot;如果删除这些边就不会被判欺诈&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>反事实解释在反欺诈中尤为有用——它回答&quot;这个账号需要改变什么才能被判定为正常？&quot;，帮助分析师理解模型的决策边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>欺诈检测利用图结构信号（邻域模式、子图拓扑）而非仅靠节点特征</li>\n<li>异质性感知 GNN（CARE-GNN、PC-GNN）解决欺诈图中标签不一致的问题</li>\n<li>多关系图从设备/交易/社交多维度提供互补的异常信号</li>\n<li>对抗鲁棒性设计（GNNGuard、鲁棒聚合）防止欺诈者针对模型做规避</li>\n<li>工业部署采用实时 + 延迟 + 深度调查的多层架构</li>\n<li>GNN 解释方法（尤其是反事实解释）支持人机协同的审核流程</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章节：<a href=\"recommender-knowledge-graphs\">推荐系统与知识图谱</a>展示了 GNN 在另一类异构图上的应用</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../../ab-testing-statistics/advanced-testing/interference-network-effects\">A/B 测试 - 网络效应干扰</a>讨论了网络中的溢出效应——反欺诈中经常需要评估干预措施是否真正减少了欺诈传播</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"社交网络与欺诈检测","id":"社交网络与欺诈检测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"异质性感知的 GNN","id":"异质性感知的-gnn"},{"level":2,"text":"GNN 反欺诈的图构建","id":"gnn-反欺诈的图构建"},{"level":2,"text":"对抗鲁棒性","id":"对抗鲁棒性"},{"level":2,"text":"时序反欺诈系统","id":"时序反欺诈系统"},{"level":2,"text":"可解释性：从预测到解释","id":"可解释性-从预测到解释"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"推荐系统与知识图谱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/applications/recommender-knowledge-graphs"},"next":{"title":"PyG 框架深入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/engineering/pyg-framework"}}